# (BERLIN) a white key's release always reaches the Lead, whatever took the key meanwhile (the review: the release
# lost under REC, the effects, PERFORM, the Pattern page left the Lead sounding and the generated Lead silent)
wait 500
# REC pressed while a Lead key is held, the key let go under it
key w3 down
wait 300
expect lastnote_ch3 67
press REC
wait 200
key w3 up
wait 200
release REC
wait 3000
expect bass_level <5
# SEL (PERFORM) while held
key w3 down
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 200
key w3 up
wait 3000
expect bass_level <5
tap SEL
wait 300
# the Pattern page opened while held
key w3 down
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 200
key w3 up
wait 3000
expect bass_level <5
tap HOME
wait 300
